result.consumers:
Who reads each month output, and when.

tourism.monthly
- On the same tick (budget and advisors run after tourism):
  - budget reads venueVisits and attractiveness (venue income) and data.tourists ('tourism' income);
  - advisors read them in depthRules (the tourism rules).
- Daily:
  - demand.ts:241 reads data.tourism (CS jobs from visitors);
  - demand reads data.migration and migrants (R targets);
  - approval.ts:379 reads tourists (the approval term);
  - desirability.ts:292 reads st.visitors (the 'Visitors' term). This is sim-side, so slicing the raster changes results.
